{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ovp8vxcoo62f87cg", "title": "28.大模型评估指标BLEU、ROUGE、Perplexity适用场景", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u05869486\" id=\"u05869486\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fbdb3db\" id=\"u2fbdb3db\">根据要求，我将结合真实项目案例，分点解析BLEU、ROUGE、Perplexity三大评估指标的适用场景，并提供示例回答框架。内容严格遵循您要求的格式，专业性与可读性并重。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"DgG4V\" id=\"DgG4V\"><span data-lake-id=\"u749e8de1\" id=\"u749e8de1\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufe8a4d99\" id=\"ufe8a4d99\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751690030232-a27e8fe6-fd72-48eb-b61e-92fc9d301652.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2c93050f-140a-4c2e-8d11-76930a32350%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u08f4865f-2582-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1092%2C%22height%22%3A608%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A104422%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1092%2C%22originHeight%22%3A608%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PERPLEXITY%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A788%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUGE%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A794%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A205%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLEU%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A791%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A792%2C%22y%22%3A414%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A793%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%22%2C%2